"Marda has sent three letters to the Thornmere Guild hall for a holy mage; each was set aside."
"Marda knows the Hollow's Guild seal was set a century ago and suspects the blight comes from it."
"A mana card that lit white-gold for a stranger would make Marda write to Thornmere at once."
"Marda lost her own partner to a corrupted wyrm; she will not send young people to the deep wood."
